## Model card and raw evidence

Three completed fresh searches covering official identity, independent benchmarks and API/context/pricing did not establish an Owo 2.5 language model. Additional exact-name searches encountered human-verification challenges and supply no negative evidence.

The discovered [OwO.AI website](https://owo.ai) describes Human World Models and a wearable human-behavior sensing platform, not a released `owo-2.5` text/image conversational checkpoint or token-priced API. Similar spelling alone cannot map this company to the requested model. Discord OwO Bot and other vendors' 2.5 models are unrelated leads.

The [live Zen catalog](https://opencode.ai/zen/v1/models), retrieved October 27, has no `owo-2.5` route. Local metadata's September 2026 release, 1,048,576 context, 256,000 output and $0.40/$3.20 pricing remain unsupported by recovered public documentation. Publisher, cutoff, architecture, actual modalities, access and licensing are unresolved.

No verified public exact-model reasoning, tool-use, coding, vision or long-context retrieval score found. No proxy model results imported.

